  <KebabTweaks.SettingsCategory>HSK kebab tweaks</KebabTweaks.SettingsCategory>
  <KebabTweaks.RequiresRestartTooltip>Enabling/disabling this patch applies only after a game restart — marked yellow when not yet applied.</KebabTweaks.RequiresRestartTooltip>
  <KebabTweaks.SupersededStandaloneTooltip>This feature is silent-skipped because the old standalone mod/patch is still enabled. Disable that mod in the mod list and restart.</KebabTweaks.SupersededStandaloneTooltip>
  <KebabTweaks.ResetAll>Full reset of all settings</KebabTweaks.ResetAll>
  <KebabTweaks.ResetAllConfirm>Reset all HSK kebab tweaks settings to their default values?</KebabTweaks.ResetAllConfirm>
  <KebabTweaks.ResetFeature>Reset</KebabTweaks.ResetFeature>
  <KebabTweaks.ResetFeatureConfirm>Reset settings for {FEATURE} to defaults?</KebabTweaks.ResetFeatureConfirm>
  <KebabTweaks.EnableLoggingConfirmTitle>Enable logging?</KebabTweaks.EnableLoggingConfirmTitle>
  <KebabTweaks.EnableLoggingConfirm>Verbose logging writes diagnostic messages to Player.log. Only enable it when you need to troubleshoot this feature.\n\nDo not enable logging if you do not know what you are doing.</KebabTweaks.EnableLoggingConfirm>
