  <KebabTweaks.Patch.CatCrazyTime>Cat Crazy Time Fix</KebabTweaks.Patch.CatCrazyTime>
  <KebabTweaks.Patch.CatCrazyTime.Tooltip>Fixes CrazyTime toil load/resume issues for cats.</KebabTweaks.Patch.CatCrazyTime.Tooltip>

  <KebabTweaks.Patch.CatFloorSleep>Cat Floor Sleep Fix</KebabTweaks.Patch.CatFloorSleep>
  <KebabTweaks.Patch.CatFloorSleep.Tooltip>Fixes domestic cat floor LayDown reservation conflicts.</KebabTweaks.Patch.CatFloorSleep.Tooltip>

  <KebabTweaks.Patch.ArmorRacksAssignFix>Armor Racks Assign Fix</KebabTweaks.Patch.ArmorRacksAssignFix>
  <KebabTweaks.Patch.ArmorRacksAssignFix.Tooltip>Fixes Armor Racks Set Owner / assign when a colonist is in cryptosleep or another container (pawn.Map is null).</KebabTweaks.Patch.ArmorRacksAssignFix.Tooltip>

  <KebabTweaks.Patch.CeRunForCoverDestFix>CE Run For Cover Dest Fix</KebabTweaks.Patch.CeRunForCoverDestFix>
  <KebabTweaks.Patch.CeRunForCoverDestFix.Tooltip>Fixes Combat Extended RunForCover destination reservation cleanup.</KebabTweaks.Patch.CeRunForCoverDestFix.Tooltip>

  <KebabTweaks.Patch.CeProjectileNullSoundFix>CE Projectile Null Sound Fix</KebabTweaks.Patch.CeProjectileNullSoundFix>
  <KebabTweaks.Patch.CeProjectileNullSoundFix.Tooltip>Skips Combat Extended projectile sound when the launcher or sound def is missing.</KebabTweaks.Patch.CeProjectileNullSoundFix.Tooltip>

  <KebabTweaks.Patch.FishTableTypeListFix>Fish Table Type List Fix</KebabTweaks.Patch.FishTableTypeListFix>
  <KebabTweaks.Patch.FishTableTypeListFix.Tooltip>Guards Performance Fish ListerThings type-list corruption.</KebabTweaks.Patch.FishTableTypeListFix.Tooltip>

  <KebabTweaks.Patch.GetActiveRitualsFix>Get Active Rituals Fix</KebabTweaks.Patch.GetActiveRitualsFix>
  <KebabTweaks.Patch.GetActiveRitualsFix.Tooltip>Returns a fresh list from IdeoManager.GetActiveRituals.</KebabTweaks.Patch.GetActiveRitualsFix.Tooltip>

  <KebabTweaks.Patch.GrowerCutTrees>Grower Cut Trees</KebabTweaks.Patch.GrowerCutTrees>
  <KebabTweaks.Patch.GrowerCutTrees.Tooltip>Adds farmer sub-work for cutting trees in growing zones before sowing.</KebabTweaks.Patch.GrowerCutTrees.Tooltip>

  <KebabTweaks.Patch.IdleErrorWanderFix>Idle Error Wander Fix</KebabTweaks.Patch.IdleErrorWanderFix>
  <KebabTweaks.Patch.IdleErrorWanderFix.Tooltip>Fixes IdleError wait-job errors when lord wander fails.</KebabTweaks.Patch.IdleErrorWanderFix.Tooltip>

  <KebabTweaks.Patch.AllowToolHaulUrgentlyNreFix>Allow Tool Haul Urgently NRE Fix</KebabTweaks.Patch.AllowToolHaulUrgentlyNreFix>
  <KebabTweaks.Patch.AllowToolHaulUrgentlyNreFix.Tooltip>Guards Allow Tool HaulUrgentlyCacheHandler when map designationManager is null during HugsLib FixedUpdate.</KebabTweaks.Patch.AllowToolHaulUrgentlyNreFix.Tooltip>

  <KebabTweaks.Patch.DubsAnalyzerBeginUpdateFix>Dubs Analyzer BeginUpdate Fix</KebabTweaks.Patch.DubsAnalyzerBeginUpdateFix>
  <KebabTweaks.Patch.DubsAnalyzerBeginUpdateFix.Tooltip>Closes a stale Dubs Performance Analyzer update cycle before BeginUpdate logs CRITICAL (often when opening the analyzer UI).</KebabTweaks.Patch.DubsAnalyzerBeginUpdateFix.Tooltip>

  <KebabTweaks.Patch.DebugLogSplitterDragFix>Debug Log Splitter Drag Fix</KebabTweaks.Patch.DebugLogSplitterDragFix>
  <KebabTweaks.Patch.DebugLogSplitterDragFix.Tooltip>Clears a stuck Debug Log stack-trace splitter drag after Alt+Tab if the left mouse button is no longer held.</KebabTweaks.Patch.DebugLogSplitterDragFix.Tooltip>

  <KebabTweaks.Patch.LowTpsPawnDump>Low TPS Pawn Dump</KebabTweaks.Patch.LowTpsPawnDump>
  <KebabTweaks.Patch.LowTpsPawnDump.Tooltip>Logs pawn jobs when the HSK on-screen TPS counter drops below a threshold.</KebabTweaks.Patch.LowTpsPawnDump.Tooltip>

  <KebabTweaks.Patch.IdleWorkSearchCooldown>Idle Work Search Cooldown</KebabTweaks.Patch.IdleWorkSearchCooldown>
  <KebabTweaks.Patch.IdleWorkSearchCooldown.Tooltip>After a colonist finds no work, delays the next full JobGiver_Work scan for the configured tick count (0–100000). Minimum interval after a failed scan; vanilla wander timing (~125–200 ticks) still applies. Reduces TPS loss from idle pawns repeatedly scanning all work priorities.</KebabTweaks.Patch.IdleWorkSearchCooldown.Tooltip>

  <KebabTweaks.Patch.PtgMedicalCare>PTG Medical Care Fix</KebabTweaks.Patch.PtgMedicalCare>
  <KebabTweaks.Patch.PtgMedicalCare.Tooltip>Fixes MedicalCare header IndexOutOfRange with extended medicine.</KebabTweaks.Patch.PtgMedicalCare.Tooltip>

  <KebabTweaks.Patch.SeedsPleaseSowFix>SeedsPlease Sow Fix</KebabTweaks.Patch.SeedsPleaseSowFix>
  <KebabTweaks.Patch.SeedsPleaseSowFix.Tooltip>Fixes SeedsPlease TargetB NRE and SowWithSeeds toil clamp.</KebabTweaks.Patch.SeedsPleaseSowFix.Tooltip>

  <KebabTweaks.Patch.TakeFromMending>Take From Mending Fix</KebabTweaks.Patch.TakeFromMending>
  <KebabTweaks.Patch.TakeFromMending.Tooltip>Fixes the Take from button for MendAndRecycle / bills.</KebabTweaks.Patch.TakeFromMending.Tooltip>

  <KebabTweaks.Patch.TradeCaravanLordFix>Trade Caravan Lord Fix</KebabTweaks.Patch.TradeCaravanLordFix>
  <KebabTweaks.Patch.TradeCaravanLordFix.Tooltip>Fixes TradeWithColony NRE / FindTrader / stamp hygiene.</KebabTweaks.Patch.TradeCaravanLordFix.Tooltip>

  <KebabTweaks.Patch.ApparelPolicyLoad>Apparel Policy Load</KebabTweaks.Patch.ApparelPolicyLoad>
  <KebabTweaks.Patch.ApparelPolicyLoad.Tooltip>When loading a saved apparel policy via Save Storage Settings, create a new policy named after the save file instead of overwriting the selected one.</KebabTweaks.Patch.ApparelPolicyLoad.Tooltip>

  <KebabTweaks.Patch.BillRenamePrefill>Bill Rename Prefill</KebabTweaks.Patch.BillRenamePrefill>
  <KebabTweaks.Patch.BillRenamePrefill.Tooltip>Prefills Better Workbench Management bill rename with the current label and selects all text.</KebabTweaks.Patch.BillRenamePrefill.Tooltip>

  <KebabTweaks.Patch.RecipeProductDropLostLog>Recipe Drop Lost Log</KebabTweaks.Patch.RecipeProductDropLostLog>
  <KebabTweaks.Patch.RecipeProductDropLostLog.Tooltip>Tracks items lost to «could not drop recipe product» in KebabTweaks/RecipeProductDropLost.log.</KebabTweaks.Patch.RecipeProductDropLostLog.Tooltip>

  <KebabTweaks.Patch.StorageSettingsAllowedToAcceptFix>Storage AllowedToAccept Fix</KebabTweaks.Patch.StorageSettingsAllowedToAcceptFix>
  <KebabTweaks.Patch.StorageSettingsAllowedToAcceptFix.Tooltip>Guards StorageSettings.AllowedToAccept when filter or parent is null.</KebabTweaks.Patch.StorageSettingsAllowedToAcceptFix.Tooltip>

  <KebabTweaks.Patch.HospitalityGuestApparelOptimizeFix>Hospitality Guest Apparel Optimize Fix</KebabTweaks.Patch.HospitalityGuestApparelOptimizeFix>
  <KebabTweaks.Patch.HospitalityGuestApparelOptimizeFix.Tooltip>Fixes Hospitality guest apparel optimize NRE on invalid apparel records.</KebabTweaks.Patch.HospitalityGuestApparelOptimizeFix.Tooltip>

  <KebabTweaks.Patch.NeanderthalChiefLeaderFix>Neanderthal Chief Leader Fix</KebabTweaks.Patch.NeanderthalChiefLeaderFix>
  <KebabTweaks.Patch.NeanderthalChiefLeaderFix.Tooltip>Removes inherited CE Melee skill floors from Neanderthal tribal chiefs and guards worldgen when leader generation returns null.</KebabTweaks.Patch.NeanderthalChiefLeaderFix.Tooltip>

  <KebabTweaks.Patch.MapPreviewRngBaselineFix>Map Preview RNG Baseline Fix</KebabTweaks.Patch.MapPreviewRngBaselineFix>
  <KebabTweaks.Patch.MapPreviewRngBaselineFix.Tooltip>Stops Map Preview false accuracy Errors when the HSK 1.6 Alpha vanilla RNG baseline drifts, and keeps preview SkipIterations in sync with the measured value.</KebabTweaks.Patch.MapPreviewRngBaselineFix.Tooltip>

  <KebabTweaks.Patch.UnifiedXmlPathFix>Unified Xml Path Fix</KebabTweaks.Patch.UnifiedXmlPathFix>
  <KebabTweaks.Patch.UnifiedXmlPathFix.Tooltip>Rewrites Unified Xml Export relative ./Mods paths onto GenFilePaths.ModsFolderPath when started via HSK Launcher.</KebabTweaks.Patch.UnifiedXmlPathFix.Tooltip>

  <KebabTweaks.Patch.MainMenuBgFitFix>Main Menu Background Fit Fix</KebabTweaks.Patch.MainMenuBgFitFix>
  <KebabTweaks.Patch.MainMenuBgFitFix.Tooltip>Fixes RimThemesLite animated main menu background clipping when UI Scale is greater than 1.</KebabTweaks.Patch.MainMenuBgFitFix.Tooltip>

  <KebabTweaks.Patch.RimatomicsGuidancePanelFix>Rimatomics Guidance Panel Fix</KebabTweaks.Patch.RimatomicsGuidancePanelFix>
  <KebabTweaks.Patch.RimatomicsGuidancePanelFix.Tooltip>Fixes the Rimatomics research panel when a project has no unlock icons (Guidance System), so the panel draws steps and buttons and stops BeginScrollView/EndScrollView errors.</KebabTweaks.Patch.RimatomicsGuidancePanelFix.Tooltip>

